    <briefdescription>
<para>Convex monotone yield-curve interpolation method. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Enhances implementation of the convex monotone method described in &quot;Interpolation Methods for Curve Construction&quot; by Hagan &amp; West AMF Vol 13, No2 2006.</para><para>A setting of monotonicity = 1 and quadraticity = 0 will reproduce the basic Hagan/West method. However, this can produce excessive gradients which can mean P&amp;L swings for some curves. Setting monotonicity &lt; 1 and/or quadraticity &gt; 0 produces smoother curves. Extra enhancement to avoid negative values (if required) is in place. </para>    </detaileddescription>
